  "briefing": {
    "hook": "At the stroke of the midnight bell, the village bell sounded though the rope in the tower was never pulled and the door was bolted from the inside the entire time.",
    "context": "The bell tower is sealed and unattended after dusk. The rope hangs untouched; the single door bolts from within.",
    "tension": "Either something rang the bell without anyone touching it, or someone inside the tower rang it and the door was never opened. The two facts do not sit easily together.",
    "objective": "Decide who caused the bell to sound, how, and why without assuming the obvious answer."
  },
